# SHA-256 checksums for the s6-overlay release tarballs the Dockerfile fetches.
#
# Copied verbatim from the .sha256 files published beside each tarball at
# https://github.com/just-containers/s6-overlay/releases/tag/v3.2.3.2
#
# The Dockerfile selects the two lines matching the build's TARGETARCH, asserts
# it found exactly two, and runs `sha256sum -c` before unpacking. A tarball
# unpacks as root into /, so it is verified before it is trusted.
#
# Bumping S6_OVERLAY_VERSION in the Dockerfile means replacing every line here.
# tests/docker/image_test.go asserts the version and this file agree.
#
# s6-overlay version: 3.2.3.2
5379750ed30a84bbd2e2dd74847ba6b5bd29cd0b2e3ea2ec58049b57eb2eda12  s6-overlay-noarch.tar.xz
e6befcc96a437a3831386ecfc51808c5d3e939dc5fe3c02ae9284599e8aa2408  s6-overlay-x86_64.tar.xz
b17f17a82e7a515c682a91edaf2ffdabb73f891981b6c1fd712115693a2f8b4c  s6-overlay-aarch64.tar.xz
9fc621c84370ab8fdf72dee51ba16c85a882d01bd2f3b388f8e1ee6bc03e00d3  s6-overlay-arm.tar.xz
3139bc0ddc7d51631cd646e4438bf83a649fb4ff027bfca8e769071b21b00b0b  s6-overlay-i686.tar.xz
5896010ffdc66a77da867e3256eda40072f3e375db4b52a54335a4596521fc9c  s6-overlay-powerpc64le.tar.xz
8fb0c66b2087c136d36864e87bb3b1e8590eda7934347cec13da69af59cc99b6  s6-overlay-s390x.tar.xz
85fbc5aac7b35b46e4c1f21547df85c75442876425471837875e7471331217de  s6-overlay-riscv64.tar.xz
